      "position": 3,
      "content": "The Speech-Language Pathology, B.S. is offered through Extended Learning . Please see the 25-26 Catalog for more information.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong><em>The Speech-Language Pathology, B.S. is offered through </em></strong><a href=\"https://www.csusm.edu/slp/programs/bachelors/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Extended Learning</em></strong></a><strong><em>.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please see the <a href=\"https://catalog.csusm.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=11&amp;poid=2544&amp;returnto=1994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">25-26 Catalog</a> for more information.</p>"
